@startuml
title Authentication and Session State Machine
left to right direction
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

state "SIGNED OUT" as SignedOut
state "AUTHENTICATING" as Authenticating
state "AUTHENTICATED" as Authenticated
state "TOKEN EXPIRED" as Expired
state "ACCESS DENIED" as Denied

[*] --> SignedOut
SignedOut --> Authenticating : submit credentials
Authenticating --> Authenticated : credentials accepted
Authenticating --> SignedOut : credentials rejected
Authenticated --> SignedOut : logout
Authenticated --> Expired : token expires
Authenticated --> Denied : role or access rejected
Expired --> SignedOut : clear session
Denied --> SignedOut : clear session

note bottom of SignedOut
First-admin setup is available only
when no administrator exists.
end note
@enduml
